DATA ATTRIBUTION NOTICE

================================================================================

This software utilizes ATP tennis match data from Jeff Sackmann's repository,
which is separately licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Data Source:
  Tennis databases, files, and algorithms by Jeff Sackmann / Tennis Abstract
  Website: http://www.tennisabstract.com/
  License: CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 International
  Copyright: © Jeff Sackmann / Tennis Abstract
  The original JeffSackmann/tennis_atp repository is no longer online; the
  data is downloaded from a public fork at a pinned commit (see README.md).

REQUIRED ATTRIBUTION FOR ATP DATA:

When using this software, you must provide appropriate attribution to the
original data source. Suggested citation:

  Sackmann, J. (2026). ATP Tennis Rankings, Results, and Stats [Data set].
  Tennis Abstract. http://www.tennisabstract.com/

ATTENTION:
- Both this software and the ATP data require attribution
- Both are licensed under CC BY-NC-SA 4.0 for consistency
- Commercial use of either is prohibited without explicit permission
- Derivative works must be shared under the same license terms

Citation metadata for this software and the data is in CITATION.cff.

